        "slc_0e8afc225009c212735f5db5a3ca3aaf816dcd6b73397761d2d7c3a1854a6840"
      ],
      "text": "The backend (apps/server) is an Express application on Node.js using TypeScript, responsible for API routing, an agent loop with SSE-streamed LLM responses, Docker orchestration, and SQLite metadata storage."
    },
