      ],
      "text": "The product is BYOK: it does not force a specific AI provider, and documentation lists supported keys including OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenRouter, Google Gemini, Mistral, Groq, xAI, DeepSeek, and Ollama/LM Studio or custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints."
