      ],
      "text": "The project specification targets a self-hostable alternative to tools like v0, Lovable, Bolt, Replit Agent, or Cursor-style agents, emphasizing local-first development, BYOK access, Docker-based execution, multi-project workspaces, and auditable AI-driven changes."
    },
